This small vocal and growing may not be an ideal way to build a language, b=
ut it is to learn it.  Lojban seems to have followed Loglan in making memor=
izing the thousand plus gismu a precondition for full participation.  I see=
 that folks are getting away from that, but I am not sure there are useful =
guides yet,

